      "type": "function",
      "function": {
        "name": "metaphysics_agent_query",
        "description": "Fetch high-density structured ancient Eastern metaphysics data across 6 systems: I Ching (Mai Hoa & Luc Hao), Bazi (Four Pillars), Tu Vi (Universal Multi-School 110+ Stars), Ha Lac, Qi Men Dun Jia, and Tung Shing Almanac for automated AI reasoning.",
